\f36\fs26\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 1. N\'f3i chung nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc in, ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng thu\u7897\'3f
c ph\u7841\'3fm vi tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa ng\'e0nh t\'e0i ch\'ednh, do B\u7897\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh (V\u7909\'3f Qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu) }{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f0\u7843\'3fm nhi\u7879\'3fm. C\'e1
c S\u7903\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng ch\u7881\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc in tem phi\u7871\'3fu s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng khi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc B\u7897\'3f
 T\'e0i ch\'ednh u\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm.
\par 2/ To\'e0n b\u7897\'3f c\'e1c c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc: h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\'e1c c\'f5 quan, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f k\'ea khai, x\'e9t duy\u7879\'3ft t\u7901\'3f khai, c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f
 mua h\'e0ng (tr\u7915\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi l\u7921\'3fc l\'fd\u7907\'3fng v\u361\'3f trang), thu \'f0\u7893\'3fi tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng do t\'e3ng gi\u7843\'3fm ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn, di chuy\u7875\'3fn \'f0i \'f0\u7871
\'3fn v.v... ; thu h\u7891\'3fi tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e3 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng; t\u7893\'3f c}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 h\u7913\'3fc ki\u7875\'3f
m tra v\'e0 ti\'eau hu\u7927\'3f tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e3 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng; b\'f9 gi\'e1 tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn cho c\'e1c }{
\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f cung c\u7845\'3fp v.v... \'f0\u7873\'3fu do Ph}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f2ng T
\'e0i ch\'ednh qu\u7853\'3fn, huy\u7879\'3fn, th\u7883\'3f x\'e3 (t\u7893\'3f QLTP) tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn.
\par V\u7909\'3f QLTP, Ph\'f2ng QLTP c\'f3 nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f gi\'fap B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980  ch\'ednh , S\u7903\'3f t\'e0i ch\u7881\'3fnh ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo, h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn t
\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc v\'e0 ki\u7875\'3fm tra Ph}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f2ng t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\'e1c qu\u7853\'3fn, huy\'ean, th\u7883\'3f x\'e3 (t\u7893\'3f QLTP) th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn c\'e1c vi\u7879\'3fc n\'f3i tr\'ea
n theo ph\u7841\'3fm vi tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa m\'ecnh. Ngo\'e0i ra V\u7909\'3f QLTP v\'f2n tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp l\'e0m nhi\u7879\'3fn v\u7909\'3f h}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn k\'ea
 khai, x\'e9t duy\u7879\'3ft, c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng cung c\u7845\'3fp v\'e0 b\'f9 gi\'e1 tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7889
\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng \'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f cung c\u7845\'3fp nh\'fd: c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f l}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e3nh }{
\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f0\u7841\'3fo cao c\u7845\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa \'d0\u7843\'3fng v\'e0 Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc , l\u7921\'3fc l\'fd\u7907\'3fng v\u361\'3f trang, h\u7885\'3fc sinh L\'e0o v\'e0 C\'e3mpuchia v.v... Ph}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f2ng QLTP c\u7911\'3fa m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f t\u7881\'3fnh,}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980  th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc cung c\u7845\'3fp v
\'e0 b\'f9 gi\'e1 tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn cho nh\u7919\'3fng \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng \'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft n\'f3i tr\'ean theo s\u7921\'3f u\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa V\u7909\'3f QLTP.
\par 3/ M\u7889\'3fi quan h\u7879\'3f v\'e0 ph\'e2n c\'f4ng gi\u7919\'3fa c\'e1c b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn kh\'e1c nhau trong ng\'e0nh t\'e0i ch\'ednh v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc b\'f9 ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 h\'e0ng cung c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3f
c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh nh\'fd sau:
\par - V\u7909\'3f T\'e0i v\u7909\'3f Th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd thu\u7897\'3fc B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o c\'e1c t\'e0i li\u7879\'3fu do c\'e1c ng\'e0nh th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, do V\u7909\'3f QLTP, do h
\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng t\'e0i v\u7909\'3f TNVT c\u7845\'3fp d\'fd\u7899\'3fi cung c\u7845\'3fp, l\u7853\'3fp k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch b\'f9 gi\'e1 chung cho c\u7843\'3f n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 ph\'e2n b\u7893\'3f ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau cho ng\'e2n s\'e1
ch c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu.
\par - Vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e9t v\'e0 thanh to\'e1n b\'f9 gi\'e1  tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn cho t\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f cung c
\u7845\'3fp quy \'f0inh trong quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 218/CP v\'e0 s\u7889\'3f 111/H\'d0BT n\'f3i \u7903\'3f tr\'ean \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng nh\'fdng kh\'f4ng mua \'f0\'fd
\u7907\'3fc b\u7857\'3fng  hi\u7879\'3fn v\u7853\'3ft c\u7911\'3fa ng\'e0nh n\u7897\'3fi th\'fd\'f5ng va l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc do b\u7897\'3f m\'e1y qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu thu\u7897\'3f
c ng\'e0nh t\'e0i ch\'ednh }{\f164\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f0\u7843\'3fm nhi\u7879\'3fm theo ph\u7841\'3fm vi tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng c\u7845\'3fp
\par }{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 - Vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e9t v\'e0 c\u7845\'3fp b\'f9 gi\'e1 b\'e1n h\'e0ng cung c\u7845\'3fp cho c\'e1c ng\'e0nh th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp (n\u7897\'3fi th\'fd\'f5ng, l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc) do c\'e1c b
\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn q}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 u\u7843\'3fn l\'fd t\'e0i v\u7909\'3f th}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd (V\u7909\'3f t\'e0i v\u7909\'3f TNVT c
\u7911\'3fa Ph}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f2ng T\'e0i ch\'ednh) thu\u7897\'3fc ng\'e0nh t\'e0i ch\'ednh }{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f0\u7843\'3fm nhi\u7879\'3fm theo ph\u7841\'3fm vi tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3f
m c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng t\'e0i li\u7879\'3fu \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e3 }{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\u7897\'3f m\'e1y qu
\u7843\'3fn l}{\f164\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp cung c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7875\'3f l}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e0m c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f x\'e9t duy\u7879\'3ft v\'e0 c\u7845
\'3fp b\'f9.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 Ngo}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e0i ra, vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e9t c\u7845\'3fp b\'f9 l\u7895\'3f kinh doanh th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp kh\'e1c n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 (k\u7875\'3f c\u7843
\'3f b\'e1n h\'e0ng theo gi\'e1 b\'e1n l\u7867\'3f, gi\'e1 \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo kinh doanh ) v\u7851\'3fn do c\'e1c b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn t\'e0i v\u7909\'3f TNVT c\u7911\'3fa ng\'e0nh t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp ti\u7871\'3fp t\u7909
\'3fc \'f0\u7843\'3fm nhi\u7879\'3fm.
\par - \'d0\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo cho c\'e1c b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn t\'e0i v\u7909\'3f th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp c\'f3 c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f t\'ednh b\'f9 gi\'e1 (b\'e1n h\'e0ng cung c\u7845\'3fp) cho c\'e1c ng\'e0nh n\u7897\'3fi th\'fd\'f5
ng, l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc, b\u7897\'3f m\'e1y qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc thu h\u7891\'3fi s\u7889\'3f tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f
 mua h\'e0ng cung c\u7845\'3fp do ng\'e0nh t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t ra v\'e0 c\'e1c ng\'e0nh n\u7897\'3fi th}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd\'f5ng, l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e3 b\'e1n h\'e0ng thu v\u7873\'3f.
\par B\u7897\'3f m\'e1y qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm ki\u7875\'3fm tra, ph\'e2n lo\u7841\'3fi, t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp s\u7889\'3f l}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd\u7907\'3fng c\'e1c lo\u7841
\'3fi tem phi\u7871\'3fu s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e3 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng, b\'e1o c\'e1o S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 Ph\'f2ng t\'e0i ch\'ednh tri\u7879\'3fu t\u7853\'3fp H\u7897\'3fi }{
\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f0\u7891\'3fng ti\'eau hu\u7927\'3f tem phi\u7871\'3fu thu h\u7891\'3fi. Bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn ti\'eau hu\u7927\'3f tem phi\u7871\'3fu v\'e0 s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng l\'e0 c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f
 S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh (ph}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f2ng t\'e0i v\u7909\'3f th}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp) v\'e0 ph}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'f2ng t
