\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 - B\u7897\'3f m\'e1y qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu c\u361\'75ng nh}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn qu\u7843\'3fn l}{
