\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 Ph\'f2ng qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu thu\u7897\'3fc S\u7903\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\'f3 2 b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7893\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c:
\par }{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 T\u7893\'3f 1 ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7873\'3f c\'e1c m\u7863\'3ft c\'f4ng t\'e1c ch\'ednh s\'e1ch, ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f, k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\'e0 c\u7845\'3fp b\'f9 gi\'e1
 tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn, bao g\u7891\'3fm c\'e1c c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn k\'ea khai, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc x\'e9t duy\u7879\'3ft t\u7901\'3f khai, h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn vi\u7879
\'3fc ki\u7875\'3fm tra v\'e0 ti\'eau hu\u7927\'3f thu phi\u7871\'3fu}{\f164\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980  \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e3 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng x\'e9t duy\u7879\'3ft t}{
\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e3ng gi\u7843\'3fm ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn, thay \'f0\u7893\'3fi tem phi\u7871\'3fu, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng cho c\'e1c qu\u7853\'3fn, huy
\u7879\'3fn, th\u7883\'3f x}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'e3; h}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn ki\u7875\'3fm tra v\'e0 t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp vi\u7879\'3fc b\'f9 gi\'e1 tr\u7921\'3f
c ti\u7871\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn; ki\u7875\'3fm tra v\'e0 qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng; t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp t\'ecnh h\'ecnh c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t tem phi
\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f mua h\'e0ng trong t\u7881\'3fnh v\'e0 thanh quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n tem phi\u7871\'3fu, s\u7893\'3f v\u7899\'3fi V\u7909\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu.
\par T\u7893\'3f 2 ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7873\'3f c\'e1c m\u7863\'3ft c\'f4ng t\'e1c th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea, k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n v\'e0 qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd kho tem phi\u7871\'3fu.
\par Bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa ph\'f2ng qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu tu\u7923\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc v\'e0o kh\u7889\'3fi l}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 \'fd\u7907\'3fng c\'f4}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15283095\charrsid868980 
ng vi\u7879\'3fc qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd v\'e0 c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t tem phi\u7871\'3fu, b\'f9 gi\'e1 tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa to\'e0n t\u7881\'3fnh - n\'f3i chung ph\'f2ng qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd tem phi\u7871\'3fu thu
